      "pinyin": "wǒ bù dǒng dàn shì wǒ dǎ kāi le diàn yǐng sān fēn zhōng hòu dà xīng tīng jiàn wǒ le",
      "english": "I didn’t understand, but I started a movie. Three minutes later, Daxing heard me. "
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "现在我不在衣服里面了，我在桌子上面！",
