    "sentence_translations": [
      "Watch a Movie",
      "",
      "Chacha asked me if I wanted to come up on the table. I wanted to, but could I? ",
      "",
      "Chacha said, “Watch a movie.”",
      "",
      "“What? Who’s watching a movie? Daxing isn’t watching a movie right now,” I said.",
      "",
      "“Not Daxing, you! Start a movie, right now,” said Chacha.",
      "",
      "I didn’t understand, but I started a movie. Three minutes later, Daxing heard me. ",
      "Now I wasn’t in the clothes; I was on the table!",
      "",
      "Daxing looked at me and also looked at his girlfriend.",
      "He said, “The Xiaomi phone is not very good. Yesterday it was very hot, and today the phone started a movie.”",
      "",
      "Daxing’s girlfriend said, “The Chacha phone is also like this.”"
    ]
  }
